## Problem The default formatter inserts a comma after the last ordinary statement inside a function block. Valid source then fails parsing. This is distinct from #50 (literal tabs in strings). ## Reproduce At main commit `1875d6e4f781cdba531dfddb353d6fe2cbd2732e`, with Python 3.11, from the repository root: ```sh python3.11 - <<'PY' from pathlib import Path from lateralus_lang.formatter import LateralusFormatter source = 'fn main() {
 println("hello")
}
' Path('/tmp/lateralus-before.ltl').wr
